    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-341" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-343" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; font-size: 1em; text-align: inherit"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Front Range Pipeline LLC (&amp;quot;Front Range&amp;quot;) is a Delaware limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Front Range is owned 33.33% by Enterprise Products Operating LLC (EPOLLC), a Texas limited liability company, 33.33% by WES Front Range Pipeline LLC, a Delaware limited partnership and 33.33% by DCP Partners Logistics, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;EPOLLC is the operator of Front Range.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Front Range is an approximately 450-mile natural gas liquids (&amp;quot;NGL&amp;quot;) pipeline located in the States of Colorado, Oklahoma and Texas that provides pipeline transportation services for mixed NGLs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The pipeline receives NGLs at Weld County, Colorado and transports to Skellytown, Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Front Range property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The revenues of Front Range are primarily derived from transportation of NGLs under intrastate and interstate tariffs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Front Range invoices shippers upon receipt of product into the pipeline, but recognizes revenues upon product delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Revenues billed for product not yet delivered at balance sheet date are deferred until such time as the product is actually delivered.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;During 2025, Front Range rebilled shippers for under-recovery resulting from the vacated January 20, 2022 rehearing order (Docket No. RM20-14-001) in the amount of $6,683,286.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; (See Commission's order issued on November 20, 2025 (Docket No. RM93-11-003, paragraph 37, footnote 111)).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; These revenues are reported in account 645 &amp;quot;Unusual or Infrequent Items (credit)&amp;quot; on page 114.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Front Range is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to its members and, with the exception of the Texas Franchise Tax, if applicable, does not recognize this liability on the company's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of services (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report) Front Range employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Front Range has no employees of its own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;All operations, management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC, as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Front Range reimburses EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
